1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,171
Tracheids.

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:13,033
Vessels, with their open perforated ends, are characteristic of flowering plants; gymnosperms rely on tracheids alone, passing water through bordered pits.

3
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:18,528
Sieve tubes carry food, and xylem parenchyma only moves water sideways.

